      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧪 QA Test Agents — Sticky Note\n\n**🎯 Test Plan Agent**\nCreates a short **test plan** from Jira requirements.\n\n**📝 Test Case Agent**\nCreates **3 important executable test cases** covering positive, negative & boundary scenarios.\n\n**🐞 Bug Triage Agent**\nAnalyzes bugs and decides **Severity, Priority, Category, Layer & Recommended Action**.\n\n**🔍 RCA Agent**\nFinds the **Root Cause** of a bug and suggests **Fix & Prevention**.\n\n**📊 Output**\nAutomatically saves **Test Plans → Docs** and **Test Cases / Triage / RCA → Sheets**.\n",
